    "relationship": "identity",
    "status": "main_migration",
    "concept": "Each subject kind is anchored to exactly one existing identifier column: artist account, ISRC, observed or opaque resource, or catalog. A company or songwriter input cannot reuse an artist account, so companies are never stored as artists.",
